 "Пример на числах, не из задачи: основания 4 и 6": "<figure class='st'><svg viewBox='0 0 82 48' role='img' aria-label='Пример'><polygon points='4,39 32,39 53,4' fill='#5ba8f5' fill-opacity='0.4' stroke='#5ba8f5' stroke-width='0.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><polygon points='32,39 74,39 53,4' fill='#5fd38d' fill-opacity='0.4' stroke='#5fd38d' stroke-width='0.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><line x1='53' y1='4' x2='53' y2='39' stroke='#e8eef6' stroke-width='0.7' stroke-dasharray='1.4 1.1'/><text x='57.2' y='21.5' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='2.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>h = 5</text><text x='18' y='43.4' fill='#5ba8f5' font-size='3.0' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>4</text><text x='53' y='43.4' fill='#5fd38d' font-size='3.0' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>6</text><text x='29.2' y='29.2' fill='#5ba8f5' font-size='3.2' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>10</text><text x='64.2' y='29.2' fill='#5fd38d' font-size='3.2' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>15</text></svg><figcaption>4 · 5 : 2 = 10, 6 · 5 : 2 = 15; основание 6 в 3/2 раза длиннее 4, и площадь 15 в 3/2 раза больше 10.</figcaption></figure>",
